            "id": 87284,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Передай значения так, чтобы <code>\"Max\"</code> занял первое место, <code>\"June\"</code> второе, а <code>\"Alex\"</code> третье.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"144\" /><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Max\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: June\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>\"Max\"</code>, затем <code>,</code>, а затем <code>\"June\"</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>\"Alex\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Передай три имени так, чтобы <code>\"Max\"</code> занял первое место, <code>\"June\"</code> второе, а <code>\"Alex\"</code> третье.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"second\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"first\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"third\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"first\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"second\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"third\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"136\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"144\" /><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Max\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: June\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>\"June\"</code>, затем <code>,</code>, <code>\"Max\"</code>, <code>,</code>, и наконец <code>\"Alex\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
